### Get all movies
GET http://localhost:8080/movies

### Get movie by id
GET http://localhost:8080/movies/69c873dbd09508245250e6ca

### Create a movie
POST http://localhost:8080/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Jurassic Park",
    "director": "Steven Spielberg",
    "releaseYear": 1993,
    "genre": "Adventure",
    "rating": "PG-13",
    "durationMinutes": 127,
    "description": "A thrilling adventure with dinosaurs brought back to life.",
    "cast": ["Sam Neill", "Laura Dern", "Jeff Goldblum"]
}

### Update a movie
PUT http://localhost:8080/movies/69c873dbd09508245250e6ca
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Jurassic Park (Updated)",
    "director": "Steven Spielberg (Updated)",
    "releaseYear": 1993,
    "genre": "Adventure",
    "rating": "PG-13",
    "durationMinutes": 127,
    "description": "A thrilling adventure with dinosaurs brought back to life (Updated).",
    "cast": ["Sam Neill", "Laura Dern", "Jeff Goldblum"]
}

### Delete a movie
DELETE http://localhost:8080/movies/69c873dbd09508245250e6ca 


