### Get all reviews
GET http://localhost:8080/reviews

### Get review by id
GET http://localhost:8080/reviews/69c87464d09508245250e6cb

### Create a review
POST http://localhost:8080/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "movieId": "69c873dbd09508245250e6ca",
    "reviewerName": "Eder",
    "score": 7,
    "comment": "normal! I recommended!",
    "reviewDate": "2026-03-01"
}

### Update a review
PUT http://localhost:8080/reviews/69c87464d09508245250e6cb
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "movieId": "69c873dbd09508245250e6ca",
    "reviewerName": "Eder",
    "score": 10,
    "comment": "Changed my mind, this movie is a 10/10",
    "reviewDate": "2026-03-01"
}

### Delete a review
DELETE http://localhost:8080/reviews/69c87464d09508245250e6cb
